[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6596791710","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656#issuecomment-6596791710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/656","id":6596791710,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABiTMNng","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-03T06:10:41Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:10:41Z","body":"Observed during the full current-owner Step 7d review for #901 at main `467aa319a06ef992035f509f66fe251082b44ae1`. These are proposed corrections or explicit deferrals before source writes; structural validation is not scientific approval. Exact owner preimages, primary-source capture hashes and full rubrics are prepared under `reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/` for the implementation PR.\n\nThe proposed `kgmicrobe.compound:k2hpo4_x_3_h2o` → `cas:16788-57-1` promotion would create two live owners of the same primary identifier. The complete K2HPO4 owner is therefore dropped from this batch; no grade-only change or partial chemistry edit is applied.\n\n| Current owner | Primary identity | Current membership edges | Source distinction |\n|---|---|---:|---|\n| [`K2hpo4_X_3_H2o`](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/blob/467aa319a06ef992035f509f66fe251082b44ae1/data/ingredients/mapped/K2hpo4_X_3_H2o.yaml) | `kgmicrobe.compound:k2hpo4_x_3_h2o` | 201 | MediaDive formula label `K2HPO4 x 3 H2O`; raw registry metadata give the dry salt. |\n| [`Potassium_Phosphate_Dibasic_Trihydrate`](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/blob/467aa319a06ef992035f509f66fe251082b44ae1/data/ingredients/mapped/Potassium_Phosphate_Dibasic_Trihydrate.yaml) | `cas:16788-57-1` | 3 | Existing CultureBotHT potassium phosphate dibasic trihydrate owner, with its own import history and occurrence context. |\n\n[Primary Supelco 105099](https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/mm/105099) supports CAS 16788-57-1 for K2HPO4·3H2O, and [PubChem CID 16217523](https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/cid/16217523/JSON) corroborates the three-water form. Those sources establish a candidate substance, not permission to merge the two source owners or transfer their recipes. The conflicting owner SHA256 is `c4fb96e92fd3ccbe4aa107fea350c8444633f992cf4758b5f21a6f86c804bc14`.\n\nOptions are (a) establish whether the two source contexts denote the same material and prepare a separately authorized identity/ownership reconciliation, or (b) document a source-form distinction or error that justifies retaining distinct owners. Recommendation: preserve both records, both identifiers and all 204 existing membership edges unchanged while recovering source-specific evidence. No owner merge, automatic occurrence transfer or silent alternate namespace is authorized.\n\nExisting #656 is the same substance/ownership follow-up. Its claim that the trihydrate has no record is now contradicted by the existing CAS owner. Update #656 with this collision instead of minting another owner. #459 and #901 remain umbrellas. Closure requires a documented source/ownership decision and a separately reviewed reference-preserving implementation; this Step 7d deferral does not close the issue.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6596791710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]